# TVMaze Middleware API

Middleware REST API developed in Java and Spring Boot for consuming and extending TVMaze services.

## Technologies

- Java 21
- Spring Boot
- Maven
- MongoDB Atlas
- TVMaze API

## Requirements

- Java 21
- Maven
- Git
- MongoDB Atlas account

## Configuration

The application requires the following environment variables:

```env
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://username:password@cluster.mongodb.net/tvmaze
TVMAZE_BASE_URL=https://api.tvmaze.com
CACHE_TTL_HOURS=24
SERVER_PORT=8080